    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0172","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Saoirse Gómez talks about the emotional weight of beige. The artist insists the recording itself is the artwork and that we are now co-authors.</Description>
